[gd_scene format=3 uid="uid://unit_standard_material_shading_lit"]

; What it holds: StandardMaterial3D and ORMMaterial3D features drawn through Godot's generated
; shader and the lit scene template (?litSurface=nodes). One ground carries an ambient occlusion
; map, and nine spheres each hold one feature: clearcoat, rim, anisotropy, emission, an ORM map,
; toon diffuse, toon specular, no specular and unshaded, under a shadowed sun and a colour ambient light.
; Every other material golden draws the classic path, so only this one shows a regression in
; these features on the generated shader.

